abstract: >-
  Poisson/Weyl lifts of the Alpoge-Fable Keller seed (restated). H=-i X_1 not ESS
  with deficiency indices (infinity, infinity) via whole-orbit deficiency vectors.
  The companion Lean artifact separately proves the bounded canonical-core
  Theorem E via ExoticCCR.theoremE at SHA a6bb091; the index value and full
  Theorem F remain not Lean-covered. Prior withdrawn: v0.2.2 pair (0,infinity);
  v0.3.0 s-indicator proof. No gates/channels. This is a proposed untagged
  review artifact; no new version DOI is asserted.
